OL,3,GNEWSAMet chief says PC's award marred
OL,4,Aby racist abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FMetropolitan Police Commissioner Sir
OL,7,FMark Rowley has condemned the "vile"
OL,8,Fracist abuse directed at a female
OL,9,FMuslim police officer who was awarded
OL,10,Ffor supporting women in policing.
OL,12,FPC Fiona Shaik Umar was presented with
OL,13,Fthe Outstanding Contribution to Women
OL,14,Fin Policing Award at the Police
OL,15,FFederation annual conference on
OL,16,FWednesday.
OL,18,FBut Sir Mark told BBC Radio 4's PM
OL,19,Fprogramme that Umar's achievement had
OL,20,Fbeen met with an "online tirade" of
OL,21,Fracist and misogynistic abuse.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
