OL,3,GNEWSAMet chief says PC's award marred
OL,4,Aby racist abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The federation put out this really
OL,7,Fpositive thing about this award, and
OL,8,Fthe online tirade of vileness, of
OL,9,Fracist, anti-Islam and all sorts of
OL,10,Fother abuse, and misogynistic, was
OL,11,Fhorrific," he said.
